    content: `<p>This half is about optimization. Ranking is your tool.</p><ol><li>How to analyze</li></ol><p>(1) Analyze the system. Use the funnel and the product to identify opportunities; this is worth taking the time to understand.<br>(2) Break each area down further.<br>(3) Choose a direction that makes sense in theory and for the product—not merely for the metrics.<br>(4) Design an experiment and run a quick headroom test to validate the direction.<br>(5) Adjust.</p><p>(6) Launch.</p><h2>2. Allocating time</h2><p>Ranking involves many time-consuming models and jobs. Switching between them faster and more efficiently is essential if you want to orchestrate your time well.</p>`
